WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.050
Here is a beaker of sea
water, and an empty beaker.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:08.110
Sea water is water with salt and
other things dissolved in it.

3
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:12.090
The challenge: fill the
empty beaker with pure water.

4
00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:14.270
So which method works?

5
00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.370
Could filter paper catch the salt?

6
00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:18.430
Would heating the sea water help?

7
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.410
In this mission, you'll meet
four ways to separate mixtures:

8
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:26.930
filtration, evaporation,
distillation and chromatography.

9
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:29.660
Each one suits a
different kind of mixture.

10
00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.510
Then you'll test if a
substance is really pure,

11
00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.390
using its boiling point.

12
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:38.180
Your mission: get pure
water out of sea water.
